Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:01.42,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the clothes of the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You will increase your dignity as a magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:07.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Be successful in learning spells
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:17.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the amulet of the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:19.78,general text,,0,0,0,,He grants the right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.86,0:01:23.32,general text,,0,0,0,,step everywhere in Pine Forest and Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:31.08,italics,,0,0,0,,This is a set of rules
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You will follow it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:37.50,general text,,0,0,0,,And if you break the rules, you will be punished accordingly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:42.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, stand up and bow to the head
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.61,0:02:06.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, turn around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,and bow to the rest of the magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:35.02,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on, Chan Wook, the eldest son of the Chan family,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:38.31,general text,,0,0,0,,magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:09.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations\N- Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:14.77,general text,,0,0,0,,- You've come a long way\N- So, so, so, guys
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Today we will organize a holiday in honor of our new magician - Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.48,general text,,0,0,0,,We are waiting for everyone in Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The Chan family has already paid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:30.82,general text,,0,0,0,,food and drinks in Chwiseonru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:32.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:35.95,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone should drink until they drop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Chwisonru!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:46.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chwisungru!\N- Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:51.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I remember how Chang Gan came here with little Chan Wook. It's like it was yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe this day has come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:57.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:02.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:06.57,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Govenium Pill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat before you drink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Children will drink until the last moment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We must at least try to keep up with them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t get drunk without this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I should think about my age
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What about my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.88,general text,,0,0,0,,So there are gray locks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:29.05,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems to you because of the sunlight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:30.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Look at him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:33.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Look how silky my hair is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.47,general text,,0,0,0,,So beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll keep this to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, take it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Do Hwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:07.75,general text,,0,0,0,,young master
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,became a magician of Jeongjingak, like his father
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.43,italics,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:38.99,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,You did a great job
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.58,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,since we met
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.21,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I understood at first sight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.51,memories,,0,0,0,,You are my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.38,memories,,0,0,0,,Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:56.97,memories,,0,0,0,,I want you to become my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:58.93,memories,,0,0,0,,What nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:00.76,memories,,0,0,0,,If you survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.68,memories,,0,0,0,,I will become your master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:04.89,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:06.27,memories,,0,0,0,,I finally got it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:43.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,So how? Does it suit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:50.27,general text,,0,0,0,,How to say... How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, what does your student look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:07:00.16,general text,,0,0,0,,This clothes suits So Yulyu and Park Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.04,general text,,0,0,0,,but on my student it looks just perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:19.93,general text,,0,0,0,,thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:27.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, Moo Dok. Let's go have a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, wait
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:37.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook...\N- Mister, you look so good
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:39.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Accept this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:46.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Huo gave you a govenia pill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, govania?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Need to be divided
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:55.92,general text,,0,0,0,,It is ideal for hangovers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:08.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Here, maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:13.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I was going to give it to you. True
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:16.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim, come back. Take it. Well really
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim, please
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:30.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Born under the star of the king entered Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:33.79,general text,,0,0,0,,His father used an ice stone to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,The birth of Chan Wook is the result of this witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:39.88,general text,,0,0,0,,This child is a disaster for Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Chang Gang did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:45.35,general text,,0,0,0,,He could make his son king,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:49.98,general text,,0,0,0,,use the stone to possess Hwansu. He would subjugate the world to himself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he seal his son’s gate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,and hid the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I was weak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.74,italics,,0,0,0,,He sealed everything and escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.16,italics,,0,0,0,,because he couldn't handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:08.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think, Kil Ju
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.71,general text,,0,0,0,,killed Chang Gan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:13.58,general text,,0,0,0,,If he came back...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:17.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gan would not do something like that openly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I suspect Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:25.05,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to gain more strength before the Pine Forest begins to climb
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago we successfully
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:33.31,general text,,0,0,0,,obtained a stone sealed by Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:48.99,memories,,0,0,0,,You found him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.33,memories,,0,0,0,,Bu Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:53.12,memories,,0,0,0,,give me the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:07.01,italics,,0,0,0,,She was so young, but she was able to find the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.47,italics,,0,0,0,,We must admit that her powers were truly amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that Jin Ho Kyung doesn’t believe in his daughter’s death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.36,general text,,0,0,0,,and is still looking for her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.02,0:10:20.61,general text,,0,0,0,,So I want to find her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:24.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find the daughter she has been looking for for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:28.49,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will make Jin Ho Kyung my puppet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.78,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you find a dead girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll find someone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The one who makes Ho Kyung believe that it is Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:57.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Here. Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten anything since you left Sari Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:15.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Take your time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is this blind girl sailing alone to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:34.76,general text,,0,0,0,,She is looking for a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Her friend stole all her things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:40.81,general text,,0,0,0,,and fled to the city
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:42.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Poor girl
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:46.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know where to go? What's your friend's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.61,0:11:49.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:54.08,general text,,0,0,0,,My friend's name is Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.79,general text,,0,0,0,,- “Moo Dok”?\N- How will she find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.75,italics,,0,0,0,,Sweet toffees!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:04.29,italics,,0,0,0,,- Sweet toffees!\N- Try our cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Come over! Buy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.34,italics,,0,0,0,,Sweet pies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:11.68,general text,,0,0,0,,The weather is nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom, buy a pie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I have no money
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom, buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, wait
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.23,0:12:26.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where is my money?\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Money is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.11,general text,,0,0,0,,- What to do?\N- My ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:35.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- I lost the ring!\N- Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.74,general text,,0,0,0,,The ring is also cheap
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:21.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I crucified myself there and all for nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.31,general text,,0,0,0,,- Thank you\N- Pour it for me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- Enjoy\N- Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:14.61,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,You knew who I was all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:18.66,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:21.91,memories italics,,0,0,0,,So your friend left you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:45.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:48.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting on the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Won’t you drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:54.69,general text,,0,0,0,,No. I've had enough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:57.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm already drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And you look good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:05.41,general text,,0,0,0,,so I got lost
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:11.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I get lost quickly if my head is foggy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:17.01,general text,,0,0,0,,How can you get lost here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Get up, I'll take you home
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:26.76,general text,,0,0,0,,You got hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:32.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you scolding me again? Maybe not today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.44,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not for me to scold you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:39.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake myself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:42.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:49.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I have always done the right thing. Didn't go astray
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:55.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But I’m lost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:01.97,general text,,0,0,0,,And now I’m holding your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know where my path will lead me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.31,general text,,0,0,0,,He will lead you after me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re holding my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:39.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:46.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You get lost when your head is foggy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.43,general text,,0,0,0,,All because you think about a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.47,0:17:51.89,general text,,0,0,0,,When this happens, think about one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:55.56,general text,,0,0,0,,For example, think about me now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:08.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now I'll think about you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:19.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. So, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:21.13,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:24.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You said that you dreamed of me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:26.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What did my vision tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.89,0:18:29.22,general text,,0,0,0,,That you like me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.14,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:33.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You yourself repeated this often
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Was it all a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I like you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I like you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.10,general text,,0,0,0,,My gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he really believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:47.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:49.68,general text,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you, master
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:52.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Mrs. Do Hwa would be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:54.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Finally I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.31,0:19:58.27,general text,,0,0,0,,feel like I did something good for Do Hwa as an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:01.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t do anything wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:04.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It was I who brought her to Sejukwon from my hometown
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:08.03,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s how she met Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa was so kind
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that he believed all this gossip
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:18.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan, such a scoundrel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:21.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, you are drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.79,0:20:23.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:26.92,general text,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:31.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought Do Hwa to Saejukwon to set you up with her
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:32.34,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:34.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:37.22,general text,,0,0,0,,With such appearance and skills
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:40.18,general text,,0,0,0,,can’t get a girl’s heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.27,0:20:43.27,general text,,0,0,0,,How annoying you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:46.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Huo helped you so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:51.20,general text,,0,0,0,,and you didn’t take advantage of a single opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:53.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I did
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:56.41,general text,,0,0,0,,everything I could
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:20:59.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I wrote poetry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:02.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Gived gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.63,general text,,0,0,0,,But you didn’t confess to her
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.21,italics,,0,0,0,,"I love you"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.67,general text,,0,0,0,,"Will you be mine?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.88,general text,,0,0,0,,We walked around the bush, but didn’t say anything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:16.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, you lost to the one who said everything directly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it necessary to talk openly about feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough hints
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:25.69,general text,,0,0,0,,How annoying you are
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:28.98,general text,,0,0,0,,They showed interest, but they kept their distance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:30.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Then they approached again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:32.45,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to talk to a woman about feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:36.57,general text,,0,0,0,,So she can decide whether to wait for you or not
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,If love is so fickle only because it has not been expressed out loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.21,general text,,0,0,0,,then I don’t need her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:47.17,general text,,0,0,0,,If a woman decided to leave me and go with someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.13,general text,,0,0,0,,so be it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:50.84,general text,,0,0,0,,"So be it..."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:00.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Continue without me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:03.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.85,0:22:05.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:08.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:11.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay. Have a drink with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.07,0:22:13.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:17.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Maid Kim, come back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:19.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'll wait\N- That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:21.87,italics,,0,0,0,,- Maid Kim\N{\i0}- Someday he will regret
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:23.50,italics,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:37.13,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is where people drink
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.22,0:22:39.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is waiting for you. Come in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.85,0:22:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t drink
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:45.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm out of tea. We must return to Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:47.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Get me some food
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:49.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:22:58.61,general text,,0,0,0,,The smell of women's perfume and the smell of booze
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.91,0:23:02.79,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not the place for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Loves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Dislikes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:16.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Loves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:20.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Dislikes. Loves. Doesn't like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:23.56,general text,,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:25.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.27,0:23:33.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Mommies! What to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.52,0:23:34.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.59,0:24:40.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a magician, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.55,0:24:46.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.93,0:24:49.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.43,0:24:54.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a maid of the Chan family. Serving Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.44,0:24:56.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.40,0:24:58.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Not worth it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.92,0:25:19.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it caught on when you caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.55,0:25:24.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:32.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Done
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:40.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you all evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:46.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:50.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.83,0:25:52.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.80,0:26:11.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it because I haven’t drunk tea for a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:17.90,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.61,0:26:21.90,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Huo is not here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But he was waiting for your arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.99,0:26:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:35.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Celebration for the new magician Jeonjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.12,0:26:36.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho will return drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.21,0:26:40.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows how grandpa likes to drink
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.17,0:26:45.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam, maybe we should go to Chwisongru?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:48.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Your future husband will be there
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:52.26,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Mrs. Ho told me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.35,0:26:56.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that your grandfather chose several magicians to be your husbands
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.60,0:26:59.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Among them is Park Dan Gu from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.65,0:27:01.77,general text,,0,0,0,,and Seo Yul from the Seo family
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:04.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not here for marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.57,0:27:06.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help in the royal hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:09.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think the Crown Prince is also on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.70,0:27:13.45,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your beauty...\N- Song Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.54,0:27:15.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Your reasoning has already disgraced me once
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.41,0:27:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgot it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:21.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about that arrogant magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.38,0:27:25.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to ask the name to tell Master Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.51,0:27:28.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:31.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I should have asked the name
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.47,0:27:35.89,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:41.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll see...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.77,0:27:45.15,general text,,0,0,0,,him again
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:50.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.45,0:27:59.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, you owe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.71,0:28:01.46,general text,,0,0,0,,so promise
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.54,0:28:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,- Promise what?\N- One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:08.59,general text,,0,0,0,,when I ask you to do something, you will do it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:10.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.72,0:28:13.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.55,0:28:16.81,general text,,0,0,0,,First I have to clarify something
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.89,0:28:21.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m asking because you know Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.52,0:28:25.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you drink his chastity tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.53,0:28:29.74,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Never. Never drank
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.36,0:28:32.16,general text,,0,0,0,,So you don’t observe celibacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.24,0:28:35.58,general text,,0,0,0,,No, of course. I want to get married someday
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:37.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Wonderful. Here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:43.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You are now also a candidate
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.17,0:28:45.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You three are candidates
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.34,0:28:50.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget to thank Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.17,0:28:53.68,general text,,0,0,0,,If he hadn’t vouched for you, there would have been problems
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:55.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You have already cast doubt on people by showing Tansu,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:00.81,general text,,0,0,0,,owned by Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.89,0:29:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Wook even wanted to become Nak Soo’s student
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:09.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.32,0:29:11.15,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:17.49,general text,,0,0,0,,He was upset that no one could open his gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.79,general text,,0,0,0,,so I joked like this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.58,0:29:22.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You are true
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.54,0:29:25.21,general text,,0,0,0,,so said?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.29,0:29:27.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, true
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:30.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, tell them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:34.47,general text,,0,0,0,,what punishment is due to magicians who are fond of dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.55,0:29:36.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You can lose all your energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.05,0:29:38.60,general text,,0,0,0,,not being able to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:40.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Then they will be expelled from Dekho,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.56,0:29:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,and descendants will never be able to become magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.89,0:29:45.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.02,0:29:51.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Never say that again
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.49,0:29:54.61,general text,,0,0,0,,What is bad about dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.36,0:29:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.45,0:29:58.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Ordinary spells also kill people
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.53,0:30:00.95,general text,,0,0,0,,And dark magic, sometimes, can save lives
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.83,0:30:03.83,general text,,0,0,0,,How to separate one from the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:07.79,general text,,0,0,0,,we need to think about human intentions, this is more important
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:11.17,general text,,0,0,0,,So you would use this magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,if this saves someone's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.05,0:30:17.01,general text,,0,0,0,,If this magic saves someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:21.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t see any problem
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.90,0:30:31.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Puppy! How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:32.94,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.03,0:30:36.16,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that you would use this magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.24,0:30:38.49,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're going to behave like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.57,0:30:41.12,general text,,0,0,0,,return the energy I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.33,0:30:45.41,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chapter\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:48.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince is heading here to meet Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.96,0:30:55.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:30:58.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.15,0:31:17.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Crown Prince! Say hello to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:37.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I came when I heard about the celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.67,0:31:39.47,general text,,0,0,0,,But it seems I ruined it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.72,0:31:44.10,general text,,0,0,0,,If you think about it, it's all thanks to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.22,0:31:47.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I must be an honored guest
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:49.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did the mood turn so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.65,0:31:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure, deep down
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:55.61,general text,,0,0,0,,you hoped it would be my funeral and not a holiday
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.69,0:31:57.19,general text,,0,0,0,,So the only thing I can do is,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:31:59.45,general text,,0,0,0,,calmly greet you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.45,0:32:07.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Funeral or holiday,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:09.46,general text,,0,0,0,,there is always drinking there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.25,0:32:13.21,general text,,0,0,0,,So I took some with me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.55,0:32:20.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Will there be another fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.68,0:32:22.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter, you should come down
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.30,0:32:25.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's wait and see
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:33.02,general text,,0,0,0,,To congratulate Chang Wook on his victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:36.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll pour him a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.15,0:32:42.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You mastered Ryusu and became the magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,in less than two months
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.87,0:32:47.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:55.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I lost the fight, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.25,0:32:57.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm glad as the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.84,0:33:01.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Deho is such a good magician
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.68,0:33:03.93,italics,,0,0,0,,This is worth celebrating
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.51,0:33:05.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Drink
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.39,0:33:09.60,general text,,0,0,0,,and become the best magician in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.18,0:33:12.02,general text,,0,0,0,,May Deho be proud of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:13.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.58,0:33:36.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll pour you some too
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.60,0:33:51.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you become a wonderful king
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.04,0:34:13.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Become a great king, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.52,0:34:32.60,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s good
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.68,0:34:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince holds no grudges
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:42.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Prince, heir to the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.23,0:34:45.78,general text,,0,0,0,,and the young man born under the star of the king
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.45,0:34:56.08,italics,,0,0,0,,Two relics of Jinyeowon are broken
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.87,0:34:59.59,general text,,0,0,0,,They have no energy, they are useless
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.67,0:35:01.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Burn them and scatter the ashes over Lake Gyeongcheongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.88,0:35:04.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mother
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:07.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Madam, the gentleman is back
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.14,0:35:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.01,0:35:11.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.18,0:35:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Wife
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:14.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:16.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.02,0:35:18.73,italics,,0,0,0,,My Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:24.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look. You have become even more beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:34.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.04,0:35:40.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I found her on Volcano Island in the south
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.67,0:35:42.42,general text,,0,0,0,,She lost her parents in childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:45.67,general text,,0,0,0,,so doesn’t remember anything about them
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:49.76,general text,,0,0,0,,She seems to be the same age as Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.14,0:35:54.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You have left
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.18,0:35:57.73,general text,,0,0,0,,something from childhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.31,0:36:05.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Unlike Boo Young, she has no energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.32,0:36:08.53,general text,,0,0,0,,and she can’t cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.61,0:36:12.82,general text,,0,0,0,,She may have lost her strength while away from Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.41,0:36:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,But if she is really a member of the Jin family,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.58,0:36:20.67,general text,,0,0,0,,her strength will easily return
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.47,0:36:30.59,general text,,0,0,0,,This door will show us
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:34.18,general text,,0,0,0,,are you really a member of our family
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not the daughter you’ve been looking for for a long time?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.05,0:37:08.92,general text,,0,0,0,,No, apparently
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:15.26,general text,,0,0,0,,But thank you for coming this far. They'll give you enough money to get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.18,0:37:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think mom will be angry because of another disappointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.81,0:37:24.40,general text,,0,0,0,,What should I do, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.91,0:38:18.03,memories,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.83,0:38:21.70,memories,,0,0,0,,The bird in the cage died
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.54,0:38:28.25,memories,,0,0,0,,You're right. Poor
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.34,0:38:31.63,memories,,0,0,0,,Until yesterday I felt warm energy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.05,0:38:34.63,memories,,0,0,0,,And now nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.30,0:38:40.39,memories,,0,0,0,,I can see, but you were still the first to notice
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.47,0:38:43.23,memories,,0,0,0,,All living things have energy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.10,0:38:46.35,memories,,0,0,0,,Through this energy I see the world
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.44,0:38:50.98,memories,,0,0,0,,Bu Young, may you not see what others see
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.19,0:38:56.11,memories,,0,0,0,,You are special and you see what others simply cannot see
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.83,0:39:02.99,memories,,0,0,0,,You made me a new blindfold
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.08,0:39:05.04,memories,,0,0,0,,I want to try it on
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.43,0:39:26.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Wife
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.73,0:39:30.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be upset
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.98,0:39:33.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect much when I brought her here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.82,0:39:38.03,general text,,0,0,0,,So you brought just anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.11,0:39:41.24,general text,,0,0,0,,So you're just trying to please me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:43.87,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why we haven't been able to find her for 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:48.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.04,0:39:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll start searching again
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.00,0:39:54.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.42,0:39:57.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu from Jeonbugwan will help find her
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.59,0:40:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you hated your stepbrother
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.72,0:40:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I hate it. But if we're talking about Boo Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.14,0:40:08.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m ready to resort to his help
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.82,0:40:15.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.44,0:40:19.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:20.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.86,0:40:23.12,general text,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people here now, come back tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.24,0:40:26.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Pushing me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.46,0:40:29.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.00,0:40:32.17,general text,,0,0,0,,And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:37.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a magician of one of the supreme families of this country
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.59,0:40:42.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Show you my magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.60,0:40:49.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.52,0:40:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,If I put energy in my hand, you would die
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.86,0:40:56.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.11,0:41:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It's just a gisaeng house. Do you not allow visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.32,0:41:03.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Today is the festival of the magicians of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.49,0:41:05.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- Sosnovy Bor?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.66,0:41:08.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Even the Crown Prince is here
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.62,0:41:12.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard she was sold to the biggest gisaeng house in Daeho
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:14.75,general text,,0,0,0,,This must be that house
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.83,0:41:17.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If you give me a name, I’ll introduce you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.09,0:41:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Not worth it. I'll be back tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:25.85,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:28.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Who was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.97,0:41:31.35,italics,,0,0,0,,She said she was from a high family
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.43,0:41:32.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I think this is Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.06,0:41:36.40,general text,,0,0,0,,She had something on her neck with the Jinyoewon crest
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.48,0:41:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.19,0:41:43.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Their magicians are always rude and picky
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.70,0:41:46.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.32,0:41:50.12,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t hurt. She's weak for a mage
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.20,0:41:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What if she lied and the coat of arms is just a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.00,0:41:57.71,general text,,0,0,0,,If in Deho you pretended to be someone from the supreme family,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:41:59.38,general text,,0,0,0,,you can die
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.01,0:42:02.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Strange girl
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.35,0:42:15.10,italics,,0,0,0,,In Deho Fortress, magicians actually have many privileges
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.86,0:42:18.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok must be there somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.58,0:42:30.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to live for her money at least a little
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.58,0:42:34.54,general text,,0,0,0,,If I say that I came to return this,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.54,0:42:38.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure she’ll let me stay, she’s kind
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.42,0:42:42.38,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, who are you?\N- Scared
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:50.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait for me outside
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.26,0:42:52.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.94,0:43:01.61,general text,,0,0,0,,She must come out
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.98,0:43:06.11,general text,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:10.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.49,0:43:12.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.45,0:43:15.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.88,0:43:25.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Once again I was touched
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.76,0:43:27.26,general text,,0,0,0,,your endless generosity
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I pretended to be kind and generous
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:34.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Could have turned this place upside down
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.77,0:43:37.94,general text,,0,0,0,,But, as I already said, I don’t want magicians to become my enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.23,0:43:41.61,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Do you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.52,0:43:45.32,general text,,0,0,0,,You acted very wisely and cleverly,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.40,0:43:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,hiding your pettiness and emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.95,0:43:52.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I decided to show pettiness only to you, Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.83,0:43:57.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I can imagine how hard it was to pour him a drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:43:59.58,general text,,0,0,0,,when you would like to poison
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.67,0:44:02.54,general text,,0,0,0,,So I rushed here as fast as I could
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.29,0:44:05.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I hate your master to the point of nausea
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.59,0:44:06.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.80,0:44:08.63,general text,,0,0,0,,My liver is burning with hatred for him
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.72,0:44:10.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.55,0:44:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,And you... you support him...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.72,0:44:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like you either
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.23,0:44:23.52,general text,,0,0,0,,My generosity was intended for you, not for him
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.48,0:44:27.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.07,0:44:31.36,general text,,0,0,0,,If you get into a fight or quarrel between us again,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.49,0:44:34.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you first
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.04,0:44:42.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, if I am to die by your sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.84,0:44:46.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t hold a grudge against you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.76,0:44:50.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you serve the master in any case?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.18,0:44:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,What a faithful servant
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:53.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should build a monument to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:57.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I am so honored to receive your recognition
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.52,0:44:59.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget. Disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.10,0:45:01.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Until I lost all my generosity and became petty again
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.48,0:45:04.69,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your Highness\N- What? What again?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.77,0:45:07.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Dying wish appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.19,0:45:11.03,general text,,0,0,0,,How are your wounds? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.12,0:45:16.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Should have asked earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.83,0:45:19.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. The attack was not strong
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.29,0:45:21.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, and Ho Yeom has already patched me up
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.12,0:45:25.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You were taken by surprise because you did not expect this from my master
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.88,0:45:29.34,general text,,0,0,0,,But you, of course, are stronger than him
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.42,0:45:32.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Naturally. Who knew he was using Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.88,0:45:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Fraudster
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.89,0:45:36.10,memories,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean that sachet,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.89,0:45:40.10,memories,,0,0,0,,which she hung by the latrine pit to ward off flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.89,0:45:45.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the sachet I gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.31,0:45:46.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.11,0:45:50.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Suddenly you hung it by the latrine pit to drive away flies
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.32,0:45:54.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.11,0:45:58.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Why hang such a treasure near the latrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.62,0:46:01.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. I knew you wouldn't do it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.29,0:46:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.92,0:46:07.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.10,0:46:22.43,italics,,0,0,0,,- Enough\N- That’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.52,0:46:24.52,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master\N- Leave me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.60,0:46:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Wake up, master
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.02,0:46:29.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey\N- Look at that
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.36,0:46:32.53,general text,,0,0,0,,He will sober up only tomorrow morning
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.61,0:46:34.24,italics,,0,0,0,,Gets drunk quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.32,0:46:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,He drank everything the Crown Prince offered him
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.28,0:46:40.12,general text,,0,0,0,,We should have helped him then. You're the only sober one here
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.20,0:46:43.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I was busy, I was singing
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.54,0:46:46.08,italics,,0,0,0,,Place the palanquin
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.29,0:46:52.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Only those who are allowed to pass here can
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.63,0:46:54.92,general text,,0,0,0,,If you are not from Sosnovy Bor, leave
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:03.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t either
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.27,0:47:06.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.40,0:47:09.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.44,0:47:10.69,general text,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.11,0:47:15.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You were only allowed to enter because Chang Wook was a guest here before
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.78,0:47:16.82,general text,,0,0,0,,But now everything is different
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.90,0:47:19.49,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a member of Sosnovy Bor, and you are not
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.24,0:47:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,So you can’t
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.45,0:47:23.45,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.54,0:47:26.91,general text,,0,0,0,,He is very drunk. I have to take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.00,0:47:30.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Chongjingak's servants will take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.17,0:47:34.38,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.88,0:47:38.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I must be close to the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.80,0:47:40.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me in
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.14,0:47:42.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Let her in already
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.89,0:47:45.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk will do something if she’s not around
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.56,0:47:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Not a single magician of Jeongjingak has the privilege of his own maid
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.11,0:47:54.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook entered Sosnovy Bor, so he must follow our rules
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.15,0:47:57.24,general text,,0,0,0,,So I really can’t log in?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.32,0:47:58.78,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.41,0:48:01.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Go home for now
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.70,0:48:03.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Uk home when he wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.66,0:48:05.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook can’t leave
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.75,0:48:09.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He cannot leave Sosnovy Bor until he completes his training
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.33,0:48:10.83,general text,,0,0,0,,This is also a rule
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.29,0:48:15.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. We stayed here too
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.38,0:48:17.34,general text,,0,0,0,,That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.42,0:48:20.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t get in and my master can’t get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.47,0:48:22.35,general text,,0,0,0,,And we can’t be together?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.43,0:48:25.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Once I understand, go home with them
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:28.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.66,0:48:46.62,general text,,0,0,0,,It's Chan Wook's first day in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.70,0:48:49.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want him to break the rules on his first day?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.80,0:48:59.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.26,0:49:05.05,italics,,0,0,0,,If you stand there, she won’t leave
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.14,0:49:07.77,italics,,0,0,0,,If the head finds out, I’ll punish her
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.85,0:49:09.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.31,0:49:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, go home. We'll find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.36,0:49:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.49,0:49:30.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.58,0:49:32.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.31,0:49:50.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.60,0:49:51.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.69,0:49:56.23,general text,,0,0,0,,You have grown into a beautiful girl
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.27,0:50:00.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Huo, one drunken magician was delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.23,0:50:01.61,general text,,0,0,0,,due to his heavy breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.69,0:50:05.32,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s just drunk, take care of him yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.41,0:50:08.87,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Chan Wook. You gave him your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.95,0:50:11.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What? Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.66,0:50:12.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.48,0:50:37.27,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,It’s that magician
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.98,0:50:42.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Yoon Ok, come here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.40,0:50:43.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:52.70,general text,,0,0,0,,His energy gates were closed for many years, and I opened them for him
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.29,0:50:56.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I even gave him my energy. His name is Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.96,0:50:59.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.13,0:51:02.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Only a month has passed and he has already mastered Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.76,0:51:03.92,general text,,0,0,0,,He's a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.42,0:51:05.55,general text,,0,0,0,,For a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.88,0:51:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Really a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.23,0:51:25.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm very drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.65,0:51:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go to my room and go to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.74,0:51:30.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.95,0:51:32.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.79,0:51:34.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.97,0:51:52.72,general text,,0,0,0,,We meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.64,0:51:56.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.28,0:52:15.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t come all this way to give up
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.21,0:52:19.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll get inside by any means necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.27,0:52:37.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.40,0:52:46.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.78,0:52:51.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Your master is dying. My head is spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.49,0:53:33.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.74,0:53:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,if you leave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.45,0:53:41.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I swear I will kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.86,0:54:09.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.61,0:54:13.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe you were still here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.74,0:54:15.99,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was right
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.12,0:54:19.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I will never leave
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.08,0:54:24.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I must be with the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.46,0:54:29.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Sitting here will not solve the problem
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.80,0:54:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Just make Uka break the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.55,0:54:35.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Then all his labors will be in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:38.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You are right
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.85,0:54:41.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Go home, wait there
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.39,0:54:43.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will accompany you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.57,0:54:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.95,0:54:59.66,general text,,0,0,0,,that I will find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.45,0:55:02.95,general text,,0,0,0,,get to Sosnovy Bor to the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:07.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him to hold out until then
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.79,0:55:12.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.69,0:56:09.81,general text,,0,0,0,,My head hurts so much
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.65,0:56:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s all the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.36,0:56:17.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.49,0:56:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,- Bring some water\N{\i1}- Who is Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.29,0:56:25.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.45,0:56:28.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t remember? We met at the inn
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.62,0:56:31.88,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.96,0:56:34.92,memories,,0,0,0,,You were staring at her the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.92,0:56:38.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ta Sun something there
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.13,0:56:40.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly, Song Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.68,0:56:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.89,0:56:47.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress Ho is the granddaughter of Master Ho Yeom
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.39,0:56:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.02,0:56:51.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.52,0:56:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,If she tells Master Huo,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.90,0:56:55.73,general text,,0,0,0,,how rude you were to her, the master will be angry with you
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.48,0:56:58.65,general text,,0,0,0,,He never liked me anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.74,0:56:59.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Let him say
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.32,0:57:04.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, at least thank her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.83,0:57:06.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Mistress took care of you all night
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.62,0:57:07.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Your lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.71,0:57:18.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better not to mention this to her
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.13,0:57:23.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you met Uk yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.01,0:57:24.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.01,0:57:29.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook helped Yoon Ok when she was in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.06,0:57:31.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.48,0:57:34.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk is not one of those who just helps people
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.94,0:57:37.86,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.15,0:57:41.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you arrived from the Vol fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.61,0:57:46.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Me and the gentleman’s mother are from there
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.33,0:57:50.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- I see\N - Perhaps that’s why
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.75,0:57:52.92,general text,,0,0,0,,you remind me of Mrs. Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.46,0:57:57.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you and my master are destined to be together
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.71,0:58:02.09,general text,,0,0,0,,If people from the same city should be similar,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.68,0:58:04.93,general text,,0,0,0,,then you too must be similar to each other
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.93,0:58:08.89,general text,,0,0,0,,But you have nothing in common
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.02,0:58:12.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand what you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.73,0:58:15.31,italics,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim, you are great,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.40,0:58:19.69,general text,,0,0,0,,but sometimes you exaggerate and make hasty conclusions
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.57,0:58:23.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'm lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.20,0:58:25.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t say that
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.12,0:58:27.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.74,0:58:31.12,general text,,0,0,0,,They were upset and even called themselves a liar
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.20,0:58:32.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.37,0:58:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm an easily upset liar
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.79,0:58:37.88,general text,,0,0,0,,When did I call you a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.96,0:58:40.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Now that’s exactly what you said
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.30,0:58:41.55,general text,,0,0,0,,These were your words
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.63,0:58:42.92,italics,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong with you?\N- It's your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of relationship do they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.89,0:58:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,They have a strange and peculiar relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.60,0:58:53.77,general text,,0,0,0,,attached
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.85,0:58:56.23,italics,,0,0,0,,- You were the first to be upset\N- You said that I was lying
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.31,0:58:58.27,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that they are close, but there is nothing special there
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.36,0:59:00.52,general text,,0,0,0,,- You yourself sat here, repeated...\N-{\i1} But you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.61,0:59:03.82,general text,,0,0,0,,- he's too stupid\N- {\i1}Keep calling me a liar
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.90,0:59:05.32,general text,,0,0,0,,And it’s annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.40,0:59:06.41,general text,,0,0,0,,No words
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.49,0:59:08.66,general text,,0,0,0,,We have evidence and witnesses
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.74,0:59:10.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Witnesses? How annoying you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.75,0:59:15.75,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you and Uk meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.04,0:59:19.59,general text,,0,0,0,,- Well...\N{\i1}- Madam
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.76,0:59:24.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for interfering
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.30,0:59:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.84,0:59:29.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.51,0:59:31.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You can talk here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.89,0:59:34.93,general text,,0,0,0,,This is personal!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.64,0:59:36.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:40.44,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.65,0:59:45.82,general text,,0,0,0,,The gentleman seems very serious
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.90,0:59:47.45,general text,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.53,0:59:50.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Judging by the way Yoon Ok follows,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.70,0:59:52.24,general text,,0,0,0,,there is something between them
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.95,0:59:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.29,1:00:03.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I will follow them and find out
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.25,1:00:04.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down immediately!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.13,1:00:06.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.17,1:00:10.47,general text,,0,0,0,,But this is interesting to you
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.55,1:00:12.30,general text,,0,0,0,,How can you be such a slow-witted person?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.97,1:00:14.22,general text,,0,0,0,,He is hopeless
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.81,1:00:16.39,italics,,0,0,0,,It’s like an incurable disease
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:17.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Sit down
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.27,1:00:24.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do they always scold me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.57,1:00:32.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.12,1:00:36.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you already told everyone about what happened that day?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.75,1:00:40.75,memories,,0,0,0,,I was uncomfortable with you following me,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.83,1:00:42.42,memories,,0,0,0,,and it’s also rude on your part
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.50,1:00:43.88,memories,,0,0,0,,Beauty did not impress
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.67,1:00:46.88,memories,,0,0,0,,And I didn’t follow you
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.34,1:00:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.26,1:00:52.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t mention something so shameful
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.55,1:00:55.14,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t think I’m cute
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.22,1:00:58.56,general text,,0,0,0,,My beauty did not impress you and you did not follow me
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.14,1:01:00.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m embarrassed to even think about it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.98,1:01:02.44,general text,,0,0,0,,So I will be silent
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I have
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.11,1:01:06.69,general text,,0,0,0,,common sense
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.32,1:01:09.70,general text,,0,0,0,,No, that’s not what I’m talking about
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.36,1:01:11.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.36,1:01:14.12,general text,,0,0,0,,The soul swallower who tried to kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.70,1:01:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,So it really was a soul swallower?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.87,1:01:20.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. But you can't talk about it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.46,1:01:23.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor. Keep it a secret
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.42,1:01:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, I will fulfill your request
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.01,1:01:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.18,1:01:34.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Since we share one secret, we should at least introduce ourselves
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.97,1:01:36.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Ho Yoon Ok
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.18,1:01:38.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.93,1:01:40.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I know. I've heard a lot
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.93,1:01:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Me too. This old man...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.81,1:01:44.10,general text,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.19,1:01:47.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho always bragged about his granddaughter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.40,1:01:50.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Did grandpa tell you something about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:54.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You will be embarrassed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.62,1:01:55.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:59.75,general text,,0,0,0,,he walked and repeated that his granddaughter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.83,1:02:02.08,general text,,0,0,0,,"beautiful, like a beautiful fairy." No, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:06.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he told everyone that you dazzle with your beauty
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.79,1:02:07.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Not me, unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.47,1:02:13.97,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s really awkward
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.68,1:02:16.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.30,1:02:17.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This old man...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.22,1:02:20.72,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, Master Huo shows such affection
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.81,1:02:22.81,general text,,0,0,0,,He talked about my mom the same way
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.69,1:02:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that I look like your mother
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.44,1:02:31.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I think this is what fairies look like to grandpa
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.41,1:02:38.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.87,1:02:41.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Not similar?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.25,1:02:45.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.92,1:02:49.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I've never seen her
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.43,1:03:00.18,general text,,0,0,0,,And how would I meet a fairy?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.26,1:03:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Hard to say
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.93,1:03:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sober?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.94,1:03:09.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Heard you were around all night
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.11,1:03:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.48,1:03:15.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Moo Deok. Sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.28,1:03:22.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I made tea with herbs
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.01,1:03:35.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I hoped he would drink
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.76,1:03:39.34,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.43,1:03:41.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.22,1:03:44.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.77,1:03:47.14,general text,,0,0,0,,She came with me yesterday, but she’s nowhere to be found
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.73,1:03:48.73,general text,,0,0,0,,She went home
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.90,1:03:53.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did she leave without me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.53,1:03:57.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Left your drunken owner and went home?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.15,1:04:00.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Now the servants of Sosnovy Bor will take care of you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.16,1:04:03.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok doesn’t belong to us, she can’t come here
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.75,1:04:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.63,1:04:12.09,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok thought,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.17,1:04:15.71,general text,,0,0,0,,she can follow Uk to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.92,1:04:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure she imagined how she would see you every day
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.97,1:04:21.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably upset
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.40,1:04:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Hope she's ok
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:42.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Uk found out
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.33,1:04:44.74,italics,,0,0,0,,Surely he’s going to his uncle
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.83,1:04:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Uncle won’t allow this
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.75,1:04:54.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Not a single magician had a personal maid
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.55,1:04:58.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And you are no exception
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.09,1:04:59.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.72,1:05:02.43,general text,,0,0,0,,As an exception, you kicked me out of here 20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.26,1:05:05.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Why not make another exception?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.35,1:05:10.52,general text,,0,0,0,,All because Tansu taught you
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.69,1:05:14.11,general text,,0,0,0,,outside these walls?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.07,1:05:18.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You need Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.40,1:05:22.28,general text,,0,0,0,,to keep in touch with the teacher?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.57,1:05:26.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li has already confirmed that I trained myself
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.58,1:05:30.21,general text,,0,0,0,,He saved you, but people are still gossiping
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.71,1:05:32.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone even thinks,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.96,1:05:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,what your father, Chang Gan, taught you
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.05,1:05:40.51,general text,,0,0,0,,At first people said that I was not his son
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.88,1:05:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Now they are chattering that my father taught me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.76,1:05:49.52,general text,,0,0,0,,When exceptions happen, people start chatting
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.43,1:05:53.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You quickly mastered Ryusu and used Tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.48,1:05:56.52,general text,,0,0,0,,This is too unusual
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.48,1:06:00.69,general text,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.65,1:06:03.86,general text,,0,0,0,,trying to attract attention,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.32,1:06:07.12,general text,,0,0,0,,forcing people to talk about themselves?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.91,1:06:13.00,offscreen,,0,0,0,,You can’t let the head suspect Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.08,1:06:14.92,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Otherwise he will find out that she is a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.46,1:06:19.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand that you are against
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.30,1:06:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So will you just follow the rules?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.80,1:06:25.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.47,1:06:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I got here with such difficulty
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.35,1:06:32.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t risk it for some maid
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.82,1:06:49.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to buy a spirit amulet on the black market
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.99,1:06:52.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Find me one
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.33,1:06:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,How can you ask for this when one was killed because of an amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.50,1:06:59.59,general text,,0,0,0,,If you are caught, they will kill you too
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.67,1:07:03.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I should be next to him. The owner needs me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.92,1:07:06.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all. He doesn't need you anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.55,1:07:10.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You were needed when he ran away alone and trained
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.81,1:07:13.39,general text,,0,0,0,,And now he’s in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.48,1:07:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other servants there
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.14,1:07:17.85,general text,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Sosnovy Bor will also help him
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.94,1:07:20.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t do anything more for him
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.44,1:07:22.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does he need you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.87,1:07:31.99,general text,,0,0,0,,The head entrusted me to teach you the basics
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.08,1:07:35.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I am honored to be your teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.54,1:07:39.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Rely on you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.13,1:07:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a set of rules for Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.21,1:07:48.18,general text,,0,0,0,,From these books you will learn about the virtues of magicians, as well as all the prohibitions
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.80,1:07:50.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.10,1:07:52.89,general text,,0,0,0,,leave this place until you learn everything
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.98,1:07:57.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll follow the rules
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.77,1:07:59.02,general text,,0,0,0,,You can start
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.06,1:08:01.23,general text,,0,0,0,,read
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.61,1:08:09.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.95,1:08:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.66,1:08:15.20,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.16,1:08:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were closed again
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.83,1:08:22.34,general text,,0,0,0,,in the secret room for disobedience to the head
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:25.42,general text,,0,0,0,,But here you are in the training room
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.46,1:08:28.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.51,1:08:31.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, you can be proud of yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.22,1:08:33.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You raised this gentleman well
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.60,1:08:39.89,general text,,0,0,0,,It is worth noting that the tables are low
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.86,1:08:44.52,general text,,0,0,0,,And the chairs are uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.23,1:08:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I am above the rest
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.11,1:08:48.82,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’m uncomfortable
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.90,1:08:52.12,general text,,0,0,0,,But nothing can be done, these are the rules
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.12,1:08:59.75,general text,,0,0,0,,What is your relationship with Mrs. Ho?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.83,1:09:01.71,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you talk to her about?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.79,1:09:04.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing special
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.13,1:09:10.51,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to read all these books. It's time for you, maid Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.59,1:09:13.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you need some ink before class?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.43,1:09:17.72,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I have to do everything myself
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.81,1:09:19.02,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the rules
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.10,1:09:20.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Rules. I see
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.73,1:09:22.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.06,1:09:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go. See you later
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.11,1:09:29.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.11,1:09:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,take care of Moo Deok. She's probably worried
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.78,1:09:37.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should she worry if you are completely fine?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.37,1:09:38.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I think she's happy
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.00,1:09:42.67,general text,,0,0,0,,She suffered so much because of you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.75,1:09:46.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You are picky about food, she had to cook three times,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.29,1:09:49.17,general text,,0,0,0,,when she was with you in the mountains. Carrying water for bathing
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.26,1:09:52.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Wash your clothes. Do you know how much work this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.14,1:09:57.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok has really suffered
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.18,1:10:01.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll take her to see the flowers and buy something tasty
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.98,1:10:03.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.77,1:10:06.31,general text,,0,0,0,,She will be calm if you are not around
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.98,1:10:11.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.62,1:10:21.87,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook has already reached his goal
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.37,1:10:24.87,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he really doesn’t need me anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.58,1:10:27.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,He left 12 teachers
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.34,1:10:31.46,general text,,0,0,0,,We should have poisoned him and found something to blackmail him with
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.05,1:10:33.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I trusted him too much
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.51,1:10:36.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.39,1:10:38.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.97,1:10:40.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you have an amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.43,1:10:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t do this. But now you can pass the exam
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.06,1:10:46.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to pass the magician exam?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.65,1:10:48.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? Don't talk nonsense
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.44,1:10:52.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor conducts an exam not for magicians
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.49,1:10:55.45,general text,,0,0,0,,They even have a competition there due to fierce competition
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.53,1:10:56.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Competition?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.99,1:10:58.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Hiring servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.83,1:11:01.54,general text,,0,0,0,,So they just hire servants
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.62,1:11:03.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you are the servant
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.79,1:11:08.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. But I'm no ordinary maid
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.21,1:11:09.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I refuse
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.09,1:11:12.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Why be angry?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.42,1:11:14.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard it is to get there?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.18,1:11:19.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you look tired
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.35,1:11:20.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat before you leave
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.81,1:11:27.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.06,1:11:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you from Sosnovy Bor? Have you seen the owner?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.61,1:11:33.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. I saw it. He's fine
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.19,1:11:36.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What does he want me to do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.74,1:11:37.99,general text,,0,0,0,,When will he come for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.07,1:11:40.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Wants you to live well here
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.24,1:11:42.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Admired the flowers, ate sweets
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.33,1:11:47.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He said to admire the flowers and eat sweets?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.87,1:11:48.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.30,1:11:55.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Didn’t he say when he’s coming to meet me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.97,1:11:58.26,general text,,0,0,0,,According to the rules, he cannot leave
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.09,1:12:01.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He is determined to follow the rules,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.60,1:12:04.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I don't worry about him anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.94,1:12:09.98,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I think Uku doesn’t need me around anymore
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.19,1:12:13.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.53,1:12:18.95,general text,,0,0,0,,and you don’t know who our master likes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.74,1:12:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the girl I saw in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.83,1:12:25.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Girl? Is he dating someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:27.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, he told me,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.54,1:12:30.75,general text,,0,0,0,,that his heart belongs to a girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.83,1:12:34.09,general text,,0,0,0,,which is like a bird's egg on the top of a tree
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.18,1:12:46.77,italics,,0,0,0,,And also that she has no one besides him
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.27,1:12:51.15,italics,,0,0,0,,I can imagine how he worries and cares about her
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.23,1:12:54.07,general text,,0,0,0,,When a man takes care of a woman, what do you think that means?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.32,1:12:57.69,general text,,0,0,0,,It means he is in love
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:03.37,general text,,0,0,0,,But it’s me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.16,1:13:10.42,memories italics,,0,0,0,,There were bird eggs
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.50,1:13:14.63,memories,,0,0,0,,Teacher, let's remain devoted to each other
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.05,1:13:22.76,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I almost died thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.84,1:13:24.18,memories,,0,0,0,,my crazy master
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.10,1:13:31.85,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Our teacher-student relationship will last until you become the best,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.94,1:13:34.48,memories italics,,0,0,0,,to help me get my energy back
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.61,1:13:38.53,memories italics,,0,0,0,,When I regain my strength and become Nak Su again,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.03,1:13:40.99,memories,,0,0,0,,we will no longer be teacher and student
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.45,1:13:44.45,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Can I know why?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.66,1:13:48.70,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Because then you will no longer have a reason to protect me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.12,1:13:51.71,memories italics,,0,0,0,,And I will have no reason
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.08,1:13:56.34,memories italics,,0,0,0,,to be lenient towards you
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.38,1:13:59.34,memories,,0,0,0,,Teacher! It's me, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.15,1:14:18.82,general text,,0,0,0,,So what to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.03,1:14:21.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is bad
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.16,1:14:28.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.08,1:14:31.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I miss you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.44,1:15:08.24,preview,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to teach Uka
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.32,1:15:12.04,preview,,0,0,0,,So you didn’t take him under your wing, you just locked him here
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.12,1:15:13.62,preview,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.08,1:15:16.71,preview,,0,0,0,,It was definitely Moo Deok!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.79,1:15:19.25,preview,,0,0,0,,Why does she always have to be somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.34,1:15:20.42,preview,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.34,1:15:25.38,preview,,0,0,0,,Why a letter? As long as it conveys your feelings...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.47,1:15:30.14,preview,,0,0,0,,The gentleman is already in love with someone
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.22,1:15:32.02,preview,,0,0,0,,This is more difficult than I thought
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.10,1:15:34.02,preview,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.10,1:15:36.02,preview,,0,0,0,,She was always next to Uk
